  "description": "In-process IP intelligence for ASP.NET Core in one line: services.AddSvirfd() registers one SvirfdClient singleton. With a Premium svirfd.com key it holds the whole IP index in memory, so every request looks up IP geolocation, ASN, VPN, Tor and datacentre data in microseconds with no network call; without a key it calls the svirfd.com API, which has a free tier. Bound to configuration and started by a hosted service before the host takes its first request, with AddHealthChecks().AddSvirfd() to report whether the index is loaded. Works with middleware, minimal APIs and controllers on the .NET Generic Host. For .NET 8, 9 and 10. Guidance for forwarded headers, middleware, health checks and testing at svirfd.com.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
