  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.0.2: repackaged with the corrected licence file and build scripts, depending on Svirfd 0.0.2; its API and behaviour are unchanged from 0.0.1. 0.0.1, the first release, for .NET 8, 9 and 10. AddSvirfd(Action) and AddSvirfd(IConfiguration) register one SvirfdClient singleton and a hosted service that starts it before the host takes a request (a start that fails fails the host's start); AddHealthChecks().AddSvirfd() is healthy once the index answers lookups. Needs the Svirfd package, which it depends on. https://svirfd.com/dotnet-ip-geolocation",
